      "id": "claim_957d6ebdd22d43c298d3cd73e3e2da82",
      "statement": "`GPTOSS.forward` returns vocabulary logits together with the mean of the per-layer router auxiliary losses, and optional gradient checkpointing recomputes every configured Nth block during backward; the production configuration enables it every third block.",
