      "statement": "`PretrainDataset` supports a single memory-mapped Torch-save tensor or a directory of sorted `shard_*.bin` files, optionally reads manifest metadata, detects Torch-save versus raw shard formats, memory-maps raw integer shards, and assembles windows that cross shard boundaries.",
